    "detailed_description": "Bockito is a 2D arena shooter with rougelite elements in the top-down view.<br><br>You'll take on the role of a small Bockerl, which will have to prove itself independently against a horde of enemies in several waves. In the course of the game, you'll also have to defeat strong boss opponents. <br><br><u><strong>Features:</strong></u><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Defeat 30 waves of enemies with adjustable difficulty levels<br></li><li>Take on the endless mode and achieve top scores<br></li><li>Learn different skills to defeat your opponents<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640170/extras/ffbca0a239fb5fd2329b12692ad94210.poster.avif?t=1702648909\" width=586 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640170/extras/ffbca0a239fb5fd2329b12692ad94210.webm?t=1702648909\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640170/extras/ffbca0a239fb5fd2329b12692ad94210.mp4?t=1702648909\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br></li><li>Equip yourself with different items and combine them into unique item sets<br></li><li>Customize your bockerl for the fight visually<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640170/extras/ef09a0c9308589cf672dfebaaf8f8908.poster.avif?t=1702648909\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640170/extras/ef09a0c9308589cf672dfebaaf8f8908.webm?t=1702648909\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640170/extras/ef09a0c9308589cf672dfebaaf8f8908.mp4?t=1702648909\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br></li><li>Defeat different enemy types with different abilities<br></li><li>Fight strong bosses<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640170/extras/703d2fe922f465765bf1b568d62defff.poster.avif?t=1702648909\" width=582 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640170/extras/703d2fe922f465765bf1b568d62defff.webm?t=1702648909\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640170/extras/703d2fe922f465765bf1b568d62defff.mp4?t=1702648909\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br></li><li>Four seasons with different effects<br></li><li>Improve your attributes after each round to start the next one stronger<br></li></ul>",
