y types with different abilities<br></li><li>Fight strong bosses<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640170/extras/703d2fe922f465765bf1b568d62defff.poster.avif?t=1702648909\" width=582 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640170/extras/703d2fe922f465765bf1b568d62defff.webm?t=1702648909\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640170/extras/703d2fe922f465765bf1b568d62defff.mp4?t=1702648909\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br></li><li>Four seasons with different effects<br></li><li>Improve your attributes after each round to start the next one stronger<br></li></ul>",
